  "description": "Lily, harboring a past she wishes to conceal, flees to London. There, she meets Taylor, a female doctor, and hires her as her personal physician. Lily admires Taylor, a confident and charismatic woman unlike her frail self, and her feelings grow uncontrollably... \n\nTrapped between an undesirable reality and true love, what will be Lily's fate as she embarks on a path of destruction? A heartbreaking new yuri novel from author Sage. \n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
